{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50627","headline":"月诗 · 卢仝","name":"月诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金波绚彩丽初筵，玉冕（友人蒋礼鸿同志谓当作「玉菟」。\n菟，同兔。\n）流辉满大圆。\n镜里山川同炯炯，楼前风露共娟娟。\n（清康熙间仁和孙之騄《玉川子诗注》收此诗，云见《万花谷後集》。\n）（见《锦绣万花谷後集》卷一《月》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}